{"4889560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Rush Hollow", "steam_appid": 4889560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world where color meets carnage. A movement shooter inspired by classic FPS labyrinths and 3d parkour platforming. Fight your way through a land plagued by a rogues gallery of evil. You are their only hope.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an innovative take on level design that combines nostalgic 3d platforming tropes with movement shooter mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/1f664b5551eedd3b3b76bce8b89fa7c5.poster.avif?t=1782840639\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/1f664b5551eedd3b3b76bce8b89fa7c5.webm?t=1782840639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/1f664b5551eedd3b3b76bce8b89fa7c5.mp4?t=1782840639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot crates and barrels explode with over-the-top particle effects to reveal their treasures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/a8ef3a3064d147d9d77636cb80b9f3a0.poster.avif?t=1782840639\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/a8ef3a3064d147d9d77636cb80b9f3a0.webm?t=1782840639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/a8ef3a3064d147d9d77636cb80b9f3a0.mp4?t=1782840639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strafe and slide, hunt for keys, and uncover secrets in handcrafted levels inspired by 90s shooters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/c87dd98fe1b5f6f0153f19d802c98119.poster.avif?t=1782840639\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/c87dd98fe1b5f6f0153f19d802c98119.webm?t=1782840639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/c87dd98fe1b5f6f0153f19d802c98119.mp4?t=1782840639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against a variety of enemies that will challenge your play style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/025486c6759854d15bebaee09c48ea49.poster.avif?t=1782840639\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/025486c6759854d15bebaee09c48ea49.webm?t=1782840639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/025486c6759854d15bebaee09c48ea49.mp4?t=1782840639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a world where color meets carnage. A movement shooter inspired by classic FPS labyrinths and 3d parkour platforming. Fight your way through a land plagued by a rogues gallery of evil. You are their only hope.<strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience an innovative take on level design that combines nostalgic 3d platforming tropes with movement shooter mechanics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/1f664b5551eedd3b3b76bce8b89fa7c5.poster.avif?t=1782840639\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/1f664b5551eedd3b3b76bce8b89fa7c5.webm?t=1782840639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/1f664b5551eedd3b3b76bce8b89fa7c5.mp4?t=1782840639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Loot crates and barrels explode with over-the-top particle effects to reveal their treasures. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/a8ef3a3064d147d9d77636cb80b9f3a0.poster.avif?t=1782840639\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/a8ef3a3064d147d9d77636cb80b9f3a0.webm?t=1782840639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/a8ef3a3064d147d9d77636cb80b9f3a0.mp4?t=1782840639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strafe and slide, hunt for keys, and uncover secrets in handcrafted levels inspired by 90s shooters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/c87dd98fe1b5f6f0153f19d802c98119.poster.avif?t=1782840639\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/c87dd98fe1b5f6f0153f19d802c98119.webm?t=1782840639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/c87dd98fe1b5f6f0153f19d802c98119.mp4?t=1782840639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight against a variety of enemies that will challenge your play style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/025486c6759854d15bebaee09c48ea49.poster.avif?t=1782840639\" width=608 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/025486c6759854d15bebaee09c48ea49.webm?t=1782840639\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/extras/025486c6759854d15bebaee09c48ea49.mp4?t=1782840639\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Rush Hollow is a movement shooter with a big heart and a lot of guts! Over-the-top gibs, deadly traps, and an onslaught of relentless enemies come together in a mash up of color and carnage. ", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/1bdf05db558a7ee9018b2176080930b2f21b0b53/header.jpg?t=1782840639", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/52d8288010bb38a11dac9d3bffd2d2302eb33f67/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782840639", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4889560/52d8288010bb38a11dac9d3bffd2d2302eb33f67/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1782840639", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64 bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Quad-core Intel or AMD @ 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</str